_76":77},"Unreal engine SDK source","https://github.com/Conv-AI/Convai-UnrealEngine-SDK-V4","note","Public engine integration source; the complete cloud conversation service is not included.","interactive","demo",[81],{"_57":82,"_25":83,"_76":84},"Try character experiences","https://x.convai.com/","Account-required browser character experiences; these are conversations and role-play, not complete game-generation demos.","tutorial",[87],{"_57":88,"_25":89,"_76":90},"Build your first AI character","https://docs.convai.com/api-docs/plugins-and-integrations/convai-unity-sdk/getting-started","Official Unity installation, service setup, sample-scene, and custom-character walkthrough.","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[101],"dimensions","3D","Development stages",[105,106,107],"stages","Gameplay & code","Engines & scenes","Runtime AI & NPCs","Topics",[111,112,113,114],"tags","Runtime AI","NPC dialogue","Character actions","Unity / Unreal","Further reading",[117,118,119],{"_57":123,"_25":124},{"_57":122,"_25":75},{"_57":120,"_25":121},"Projects and experiences","https://convai.com/gallery","Unreal SDK source","Unity SDK documentation","https://docs.convai.com/api-docs/plugins-and-integrations/convai-unity-sdk","Project source",[127],{"_57":125,"_25":62},"Why it belongs here","Convai connects game characters to runtime conversation and behavior services through engine integrations. Its Unity guides cover installation, sample scenes, and character setup; public Unreal SDK source is also available. Browser experiences require an account. This provides AI behavior inside an existing game, rather than generating a complete game. Public SDKs do not include the full hosted AI service.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Tool","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","tool",[154,155,156],{"_85":151,"_79":152,"_32":153},[111,112,113,114],[148,149,150],[147],"3d","code","scene","runtime",{"_57":8